  ('brief_tb_2023_01_r1','tb-2023-01-gateway-church-scandal',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-23/','Retrofit. Fourteen months elapsed. Gateway was already a large, discussed megachurch.','material_provisional','Falsifiability: Falsifiable? No. Spiritual assault is unfalsifiable. Specificity: Specificity? Named church; no scandal type, no person, no date. The original wording, the claimed fulfillment, and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: The archive title becomes a “scandal” and the result section is the June 2024 Robert Morris revelations and resignation. That material is not in the April 2023 word. Added: named scandal, timeline into 2024, abuse framing. Missing: the original spiritual-warfare / sister-church encouragement as the whole point. Analysis: Fourteen months elapsed. Gateway was already a large, discussed megachurch. “Spiritual assault” can mean anything hostile. Filing a 2024 news story under an April 2023 prayer-language sentence is the retrofit pattern for the year. Verdict: Retrofit.','Predictability: Humanly predictable? A future controversy at a famous megachurch is always available. Already public: Already public or scheduled? The 2024 story was not public in April 2023. The church’s prominence was. A reproducible prior-information search with a 2023-04-10 cutoff is still required.','This entry comes from the speaker’s “fulfilled prophecies” archive as reviewed by Joshua Harris. Because that archive selects claims described as fulfilled, it cannot by itself show the speaker’s complete track record.','["Confirm the original video URL, then have a verified human check the segment and surrounding context.", "Confirm the quoted wording against the original video; quotes here are transcribed from the independent review.", "Freeze a measurable definition of fulfillment from the original wording before any rating.", "Preserve independent outcome evidence with URLs and access dates.", "Complete a reproducible prior-information receipt with a 2023-04-10 cutoff.", "Get one named human reviewer to make and publish the final decision."]','provisional_research','2026-09-20','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
