  ('brief_tb_2024_44_r1','tb-2024-44-both-real-and-political-earthquakes-november',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-24/','Moderate. The July 2025 timing and the very large 8.8 earthquake give this one more weight than most of his prophecies.','preliminary_signal','Whether the November 27, 2024 word “Both Real and Political Earthquakes (November 27, 2024)” was fulfilled as spoken. The original wording and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: Troy connects it to July 2025’s record earthquake activity, specifically the massive 8.8 magnitude earthquake off Russia on July 30th (one of the largest ever recorded), plus a major earthquake swarm at Mount Rainier and a 7.3 quake off Alaska. For the political side, he links it to the Jeffrey Epstein files/memo released in July 2025 that caused major backlash and division within the MAGA community. The website entry matches the video closely. No major additions or omissions. Analysis: Links cover the 8.8 quake, tsunami warnings, the Rainier swarm, and news about the Epstein memo fallout. The physical earthquake events are well-documented, but the political connection is much more interpretive. ●​ Is it falsifiable? Partially — the July timeline makes it more testable than most, but the language is still very broad. ●​ Was it humanly predictable? Earthquakes happen every year, and July 2025 had notable activity, but picking one month a year in advance isn’t impressive. ●​ Is it political commentary dressed as prophecy? The political half feels like it. ●​ Is the fulfillment retrofitted? Yes, especially the Epstein link. ●​ How specific was the original word? Moderate on the dual nature and July timing, but very vague on details. ●​ Does the fulfillment match the scale and tone? The earthquake part is strong, but tying the Epstein memo drama to “turmoil and freedom” and “rumbling sound” is a stretch