  ('brief_tb_2025_19_r1','tb-2025-19-japan-yen-crisis-affecting-the-u',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-25/','Incomplete / weak as a closed hit. Interesting visual; unclosed two-year bag.','material_provisional','Falsifiability: Falsifiable? Not until mid-2027, and even then “miracle / self-correction” is elastic. Specificity: Specificity? High on symbol (5-yen coin). Low on dates inside two years. The original wording, the claimed fulfillment, and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: Date shared: July 14, 2025 Original claims • Vision of a Japanese coin with a hole (5-yen). Stack spinning. • “A time of financial shaking is coming.” • Japanese economy, but it will affect the U.S. and world markets. • Spinning loses control briefly, then “a moment of self-correction.” • “A drastic moment. . . financial miracle” starting in U.S. and Japan, then the world. • “You’re going to see this happening in the next two years.” Archive: timeline runs to mid-2027. Assessment Named currency is a plus. Two-year window plus “shaking then correction then miracle” can absorb almost any yen/USD path. Yen volatility and BoJ/Fed spillover into U.S. markets is a standard macro theme, not a hidden insight. 10 questions 1. Falsifiable? Not until mid-2027, and even then “miracle / self-correction” is elastic. 2. Predictable? Yen-U.S. linkage is textbook. 3. Commentary? Macro commentary as prophecy. 4. Retrofitted? Ongoing – window still open in the archive’s own terms. 5. Already public? Japan rate/FX drama was public in 2024-25. 6. Specificity? High on symbol (5-yen coin). Low on dates inside two years. 7. Admit failures? Timeline not expired. 8. Scale/tone? “Financial miracle” not yet shown as a discrete event. 9. Cherry-pick? Any yen headline can be filed under shaking or correction. 10. Prophesy the claim? He named the yen and U.S. spillover. He did not specify a crisis event. Verdict: Incomplete / weak as a closed hit. Interesting visual; unclosed two-year bag.','Predictability: Predictable? Yen-U.S. linkage is textbook. Already public: Already public? Japan rate/FX drama was public in 2024-25. A reproducible prior-information search with a 2025-07-14 cutoff is still required.','This entry comes from the speaker’s “fulfilled prophecies” archive as reviewed by Joshua Harris. Because that archive selects claims described as fulfilled, it cannot by itself show the speaker’s complete track record.','["Confirm the original video URL, then have a verified human check the segment and surrounding context.", "Confirm the quoted wording against the original video; quotes here are transcribed from the independent review.", "Freeze a measurable definition of fulfillment from the original wording before any rating.", "Preserve independent outcome evidence with URLs and access dates.", "Complete a reproducible prior-information receipt with a 2025-07-14 cutoff.", "Get one named human reviewer to make and publish the final decision."]','provisional_research','2026-09-20','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('brief_tb_2025_20_r1','tb-2025-20-2025-two-week-word-russia-hoax',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-25/','Moderate timing, weak uniqueness. Fast drop, obvious agenda.','material_provisional','Falsifiability: Falsifiable? Partly (two weeks + Russia-hoax news). Specificity: Specificity? Medium on window and topic. Low on Gabbard/Obama/docs as named objects. The original wording, the claimed fulfillment, and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: July 18 – two days later – DNI Tulsi Gabbard declassifies documents she describes as overwhelming evidence that Obama-era officials laid groundwork for the Trump-Russia probe. Stones • Re-litigating 2016-2019 Russiagate is a central project of the second Trump term. Gabbard’s lane as DNI was already public. “Russia hoax documents drop soon” in July 2025 is political anticipation more than a shot in the dark. • Two-week window + already-teed declassification is a soft test. Verdict: Moderate timing, weak uniqueness. Fast drop, obvious agenda.','Predictability: Predictable? Yes inside that administration. Already public: Already public? The declass campaign was advertised. A reproducible prior-information search with a 2025-07-16 cutoff is still required.','This entry comes from the speaker’s “fulfilled prophecies” archive as reviewed by Joshua Harris. Because that archive selects claims described as fulfilled, it cannot by itself show the speaker’s complete track record.','["Confirm the original video URL, then have a verified human check the segment and surrounding context.", "Confirm the quoted wording against the original video; quotes here are transcribed from the independent review.", "Freeze a measurable definition of fulfillment from the original wording before any rating.", "Preserve independent outcome evidence with URLs and access dates.", "Complete a reproducible prior-information recei