  ('brief_tb_2025_23_r1','tb-2025-23-the-death-of-your-president',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-25/','Weak. Date shared: August 15, 2025 Original claims (heavily hedged) • “Be very careful how you word this.','material_provisional','Falsifiability: Falsifiable? No, as worded. Specificity: Specificity? Title sounds specific. Caveats erase it. The original wording, the claimed fulfillment, and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: Date shared: August 15, 2025 Original claims (heavily hedged) • “Be very careful how you word this. . . be open about how little you know.” • Phrase: “The death of your president.” • Criminal conspiracy; next death in a line of multifaceted crime. • May be current, former, earlier president, an attempt, or even JFK from the past. Look back in a few months. Claimed fulfillment (shotgun) • Aug 18: woman in custody for threatening Trump. • Labor Day: “Trump is dead” rumor; Trump appears Sept 2. • Sept 10: Charlie Kirk assassinated; some call him a future president; JFK/conspiracy talk. Stones The word refuses to say who dies. The archive files three different stories. Trump did not die. Kirk was not president. 10 questions 1. Falsifiable? No, as worded. 2. Predictable? Threats and political violence were ambient. 3. Political commentary? Yes. 4. Retrofitted? Yes. 5. Already public? Threat environment public. Kirk not in the text. 6. Specificity? Title sounds specific. Caveats erase it. 7. Admit failures? No. Hedging is the method. 8. Scale/tone? Title maximal; fulfillments are a threat case, a rumor, and another man’s murder. 9. Cherry-pick? “Your president” loosened to future / rumor / attempt. 10. Prophesy the claim? Did not prophesy Kirk or a confirmed presidential death. Verdict: Weak.','Predictability: Predictable? Threats and political violence were ambient. Already public: Already public? Threat environme