  ('brief_tb_2026_12_r1','tb-2026-12-assassination-attempt-disclosure-butler-pa',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-26/','Weak. After-the-fact file on a known case. By May 2026 the Butler shooting is 22 months old. A “disclosure” word is almost always a document dump, a memoir, or a hearing – all of which that sto','preliminary_signal','Whether the May 29, 2026 word “Assassination Attempt Disclosure – Butler, PA” was fulfilled as spoken. The original wording and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: By May 2026 the Butler shooting is 22 months old. A “disclosure” word is almost always a document dump, a memoir, or a hearing – all of which that story produces on a schedule. This is commentary on an old attempt, not a new one. Distinct from 2026-4/7 (April 25). Verdict: Weak. After-the-fact file on a known case. Verdict: Weak. After-the-fact file on a known case.','Whether the claimed event was already public or predictable before May 29, 2026 is not yet assessed. A reproducible prior-information search with a 2026-05-29 cutoff is still required.','This entry comes from the speaker’s “fulfilled prophecies” archive as reviewed by Joshua Harris. Because that archive selects claims described as fulfilled, it cannot by itself show the speaker’s complete track record.','["Confirm the original video URL, then have a verified human check the segment and surrounding context.", "Capture the verbatim original wording; none is quoted in the independent review.", "Freeze a measurable definition of fulfillment from the original wording before any rating.", "Preserve independent outcome evidence with URLs and access dates.", "Complete a reproducible prior-information receipt with a 2026-05-29 cutoff.", "Get one named human reviewer to make and publish the final decision."]','provisional_research','2026-09-20','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('brief_tb_2026_13_r1','tb-2026-13-three-week-prophecy-june-2026',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-26/','Insufficient quote / weak by pattern. Short-window word; pulled pages do not isolate one crisp event.','insufficient','Whether the June 3, 2026 word “Three-Week Prophecy – June 2026” was fulfilled as spoken. The original wording and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: Short-window word; pulled pages do not isolate one crisp event. Same pattern as 2025’s five-day / seven-day / 24-hour rows: a clock plus later headlines. Verdict: Insufficient quote / weak by pattern.','Whether the claimed event was already public or predictable before June 3, 2026 is not yet assessed. A reproducible prior-information search with a 2026-06-03 cutoff is still required.','This entry comes from the speaker’s “fulfilled prophecies” archive as reviewed by Joshua Harris. Because that archive selects claims described as fulfilled, it cannot by itself show the speaker’s complete track record.','["Confirm the original video URL, then have a verified human check the segment and surrounding context.", "Capture the verbatim original wording; none is quoted in the independent review.", "Freeze a measurable definition of fulfillment from the original wording before any rating.", "Preserve independent outcome evidence with URLs and access dates.", "Complete a reproducible prior-information receipt with a 2026-06-03 cutoff.", "Get one named human reviewer to make and publish the final decision."]','provisional_research','2026-09-20','2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z'),
  ('brief_tb_2026_14_r1','tb-2026-14-four-week-prophecy-kathryn-krick-reckoning',1,NULL,'https://troyblackvideos.com/prophecy-archive-26/','Moderate in-house. Best Krick row because of the clock. Krick had critics for years. A four-week clock plus a real viral pile-on is tighter than the 2025 warning.','material_provisional','Falsifiability: Falsifiable? Partly (reckoning in ~4 weeks). Specificity: Specificity? High on the person (by context) + four weeks. The original wording, the claimed fulfillment, and the measure of a hit must be frozen from the original video before any rating.','Independent review by Joshua Harris (September 2026). Archive claim: ~Four weeks later: July 15 viral book-signing collapse video; Allie Beth Stuckey July 22; New York Post July 27. “Great and terrible day,” “I told you so,” ministry once healthy now exposed. Analysis: Krick had critics for years. A four-week clock plus a real viral pile-on is tighter than the 2025 warning. Still in-house: he had already aimed at her. Verdict: Moderate in-house. Best Krick row because of the clock.','Predictability: Predictable? In that subculture, yes. Already public: Already public? Her methods were public. A reproducible prior-information search with a 2026-06-26 cutoff is still required.','This entry comes from the speaker’s “fulfilled prophecies” archive as reviewed by Joshua Harris. Because that archive selects claims described as fulfilled, it cannot by itself show the speaker’s complete track record.','["Confirm the original video URL, then have a verified human check the segment and surrounding context.", "Confirm the quoted wording against the original video; quotes here are transcribed from the independent review.", "Freeze a measurable definition of fulfillment from the original wording before any rating.", "Preserve independent outcome evidence with URLs and access dates.", "Complete a reproducible prior-information receipt with a 2026-06-26 cutoff.", "Get one named human reviewer to make